    "synopsis": {
        "native": "A Roma, durante un fine settimana di gennaio, arriva un'improvvisa ondata di caldo. Il sole \u00e8 inizialmente piacevole, ma il caldo raggiunge rapidamente un livello spaventoso, con il risultato che persone e animali perdono l'autocontrollo.",
        "english": "It\u2019s a January weekend in Rome, when a sudden heat wave arrives disrupting the peace. In this surreal climate, people and animals start losing control. It\u2019s the beginning of a whole new chapter: suddenly, people are confronted with the things they have been carefully avoiding through their ordinary daily routines, be it food, sex, drugs, religion, or excessive romance. They can no longer escape - they must push through the heat, be transformed by it in its own voice and pace."
    },
